ionsGate Golf Club, Reunion Resort golf courses, and other championship golf destinations. Everyday conveniences are close by, including Publix, restaurants, coffee shops, shopping centers, pharmacies, and Posner Park. Easy access to I-4 provides convenient connections to Orlando, Kissimmee, and surrounding communities. ADDED VALUE: Cable TV, water, Fiber internet, and telephone service are included in the rent, offering convenience and potential monthly savings. Whether relaxing on your private balcony surrounded by nature or enjoying the community's resort-style amenities, this condo offers an exceptional opportunity to experience the Champions Gate lifestyle. UNFURNISHED | 3 BEDROOMS | 2 BATHROOMS | 1,244 SQ. FT. | SECOND FLOOR | ELEVATOR ACCESS | GATED COMMUNITY Schedule your private showing today and discover resort-style living near Disney.","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":[],"min_rent":1750,"images":[{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/79b01a6298622221301e6fb3e415d433l-m2696659167r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["condo","road","exterior"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/79b01a6298622221301e6fb3e415d433l-m2696659167s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/79b01a6298622221301e6fb3e415d433l-m2696659167r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/79b01a6298622221301e6fb3e415d433l-m353685346r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["kitchen"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/79b01a6298622221301e6fb3e415d433l-m353685346s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/79b01a6298622221301e6fb3e415d433l-m353685346r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/79b01a6298622221301e6fb3e415d433l-m3959794796r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["kitchen"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/79b01a6298622221301e6fb3e415d